      "id": "claim_52af3074f06e4242a0a0cca0534de401",
      "statement": "Validation fails soft rather than throwing: each detachment-validator check returns ValidationError[] and silently skips roster units whose datasheet is missing from the lookup map, so a sparse datasheetLookup narrows coverage (e.g. Rule-of-Three counting) without any error surfacing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
