      "id": "claim_e0870da43a6e4ddebe07f4b39dd7ffe7",
      "statement": "attachment-resolver and stratagem-filter have zero production callers: the components that render the same rules re-implement them inline (StratagemPanel filters phase/keywords in its own useMemo, CompositeUnitCard clamps wounds in handleWoundDelta, RosterBuilder computes ruleOfThreeViolations with its own count map), so an engine-only change leaves the UI asserting different rules while every test stays green.",
      "evidence": [
