    {
      "id": "claim_b7fb8510bb3a4b11aeb7317c335668a0",
      "statement": "In development the web app bypasses the compiled package entirely: apps/web/tsconfig.json aliases @forceorg/rules-engine-11e to ../../packages/rules-engine-11e/src and next.config.js lists it in transpilePackages, so web consumes TypeScript sources while the API consumes dist — meaning apps/api cannot reach module internals that are not exported from index.ts.",
